    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Midland and Odessa Texas, the most prolific oil-producing towns in the country, stand on the cusp of a complete economic collapse due to the fall in oil prices. To prevent the decimation of the West Texas economy and prepare for an inevitable fossil-free future, Midland and Odessa should harness their natural wind and solar capacity and diversify the economy by developing the renewable energy sector.",
